{"version":1,"content":"<p>本港地區明日（11月2日，周一）天氣預測：早上市區最低氣溫約26°C，新界再低兩三度，最高氣溫約31°C。</p><p>早晚部分時間多雲，日間大致天晴，稍後有一兩陣微雨。</p><p>吹和緩東風。</p><p>展望隨後一兩日風勢較大。</p><p>周四部分時間有陽光。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.124230+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T14:22:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T16:18:18.704345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771725+00:00","content_hash":"0f646478f6860eb4c7b41e72daaa29955834a87cc3e38700d3462d70393c0357","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}